","x":179,"y":2352,"width":126,"height":37},{"text":"헤더에","x":320,"y":2353,"width":101,"height":39},{"text":"포함하고","x":439,"y":2353,"width":141,"height":38},{"text":"있다(그림","x":598,"y":2353,"width":140,"height":40},{"text":"3.29","x":756,"y":2357,"width":64,"height":30},{"text":"참조).","x":836,"y":2353,"width":82,"height":39},{"text":"서버가","x":935,"y":2353,"width":97,"height":38},{"text":"이","x":1045,"y":2353,"width":28,"height":37},{"text":"세그먼트를","x":1090,"y":2352,"width":166,"height":38},{"text":"수신하면,","x":1270,"y":2351,"width":144,"height":39},{"text":"서","x":1431,"y":2350,"width":30,"height":37}]},{"text":"버는 클라이언트에게 확인 세그먼트를 보낸다. 그다음에 FIN 비트가 1로 설정된 자신","words":[{"text":"버는","x":181,"y":2412,"width":59,"height":38},{"text":"클라이언트에게","x":251,"y":2414,"width":239,"height":38},{"text":"확인","x":507,"y":2415,"width":69,"height":37},{"text":"세그먼트를","x":590,"y":2415,"width":170,"height":37},{"text":"보낸다.","x":772,"y":2413,"width":104,"height":38},{"text":"그다음에","x":890,"y":2414,"width":126,"height":37},{"text":"FIN","x":1031,"y":2418,"width":58,"height":29},{"text":"비트가","x":1105,"y":2412,"width":98,"height":39},{"text":"1로","x":1219,"y":2416,"width":50,"height":30},{"text":"설정된","x":1282,"y":2411,"width":100,"height":39},{"text":"자신","x":1396,"y":2410,"width":67,"height":38}]},{"text":"의 종료 세그먼트를 송신한다. 마지막으로 클라이언트는 서버의 종료 세그먼트에 확인","words":[{"text":"의","x":180,"y":2473,"width":25,"height":37},{"text":"종료","x":219,"y":2475,"width":65,"height":35},{"text":"세그먼트를","x":297,"y":2474,"width":174,"height":38},{"text":"송신한다.","x":483,"y":2475,"width":148,"height":38},{"text":"마지막으로","x":646,"y":2475,"width":165,"height":38},{"text":"클라이언트는","x":823,"y":2474,"width":193,"height":38},{"text":"서버의","x":1028,"y":2474,"width":92,"height":38},{"text":"종료","x":1136,"y":2475,"width":66,"height":36},{"text":"세그먼트에","x":1215,"y":2472,"width":166,"height":38},{"text":"확인","x":1395,"y":2470,"width":68,"height":37}]},{"text":"응답을 한다. 이 시점에서 두 호스트의 모든 자원들은 할당이 해제된다.","words":[{"text":"응답